Vendored HWPX components
=========================

`form_mapper.py`, `slot_filler.py`, and `fix_namespaces.py` are adapted from
orientpine/honeypot's `hwpx-generator` plugin.  They are used under the MIT
license.  Copyright (c) Baekdong Cha and honeypot contributors.

The small `analyze_template.py` and `zip_surgery.py` compatibility modules are
original autophagy-agents code.  The upstream checkout available while this
vendoring work was performed did not include the modules imported by the two
vendored scripts, so these minimal offline implementations retain the public
contracts required by the deterministic mapper/filler pipeline.
